{"suttaId":"thag11.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2480,2517],"vripara":"597"},"segments":{"thag11.1:0.4":"Saṃkiccattheragāthā","thag11.1:1.1":"“Kiṃ tavattho vane tāta, ujjuhānova pāvuse;","thag11.1:1.3":"Verambhā ramaṇīyā te, paviveko hi jhāyinaṃ.","thag11.1:2.1":"“Yathā abbhāni verambho, vāto nudati pāvuse;","thag11.1:2.3":"Saññā me abhikiranti, vivekapaṭisaññutā.","thag11.1:3.1":"“Apaṇḍaro aṇḍasambhavo, sīvathikāya niketacāriko;","thag11.1:3.3":"Uppādayateva me satiṃ, sandehasmiṃ virāganissitaṃ.","thag11.1:4.1":"“Yañca aññe na rakkhanti, yo ca aññe na rakkhati;","thag11.1:4.3":"Sa ve bhikkhu sukhaṃ seti, kāmesu anapekkhavā.","thag11.1:5.1":"“Acchodikā puthusilā, gonaṅgulamigāyutā;","thag11.1:5.3":"Ambusevālasañchannā, te selā ramayanti maṃ.","thag11.1:6.1":"“Vasitaṃ me araññesu, kandarāsu guhāsu ca;","thag11.1:6.3":"Senāsanesu pantesu, vāḷamiganisevite.","thag11.1:7.1":"“‘Ime haññantu vajjhantu, dukkhaṃ pappontu pāṇino’;","thag11.1:7.3":"Saṅkappaṃ nābhijānāmi, anariyaṃ dosasaṃhitaṃ.","thag11.1:8.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thag11.1:8.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thag11.1:9.1":"“Yassa catthāya [yassatthāya (sī.)] pabbajito, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thag11.1:9.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thag11.1:10.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ, nābhinandāmi jīvitaṃ;","thag11.1:10.3":"Kālañca paṭikaṅkhāmi, nibbisaṃ bhatako yathā.","thag11.1:11.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ, nābhinandāmi jīvitaṃ;","thag11.1:11.3":"Kālañca paṭikaṅkhāmi, sampajāno patissato”ti.","thag11.1:11.5":"… Saṃkicco thero ….","thag11.1:11.6":"Ekādasanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag11.1:12.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag11.1:12.1":"Saṃkiccathero ekova, katakicco anāsavo;","thag11.1:12.3":"Ekādasanipātamhi, gāthā ekādaseva cāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
